                <Translate>
                    <English>
                        <p>I started learning programming after joining the DisHelps team.</p>
                        <p>I took over the project after a while and:</p>
                        <ul class="list">
                            <li>migrated the repository, including the Git repository and the wiki from Azure DevOps
