                            </li>
                            <li>simplified the project structure, and later migrated from Xamarin.Forms to .NET MAUI,
                            </li>
                            <li>continued developing the app,</li>
                            <li>integrated Piranha CMS for managing the knowledge base section of the app.</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p>
